# Defense in depth only. Outputs/caches belong outside the repository.
**/.cache/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/output/
**/frames/
**/renders/
**/assets/
*.pyc
*.log
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.wav
